# Secrets and PII

- Never put secrets, tokens, passwords, or real PII in chat REPORT, `/note` body, commit messages, or fixtures.
- `/ship`: scan diff for `.env`, credentials, private keys; flag before confirm.
- `/note` stores decisions/constraints/exceptions/gotchas only — not logs, stacks, or runtime dumps (Memory ≠ Runtime State).
